  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>셩<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>심<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>데<ruby>꼑<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby>팡<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>훼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby>인<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>훈<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5vyT2qDmFhE?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>求神<rt>규신ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>切斷<rt>쳳ˆ등-</rt></ruby><ruby>世間<rt>세ˋ간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>迷戀<rt>뻬롼ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiu-sín chiêt-tng-sè-kân be-loán\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>降伏<rt>항헉-</rt></ruby><ruby>千百<rt>쳰ˉ밯ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>夜叉<rt>야체ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>惡鬼<rt>억ˆ귀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hang-hork-chiēn-pâh-ya-chê ôrk-kùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>孽鏡台<rt>꼗걀ˋ대-</rt></ruby><ruby>前<rt>졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>斟酌<rt>짐ˉ젹-</rt></ruby><ruby>審判<rt>심ˆ퐐</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    giet-kià̰-tai-jiéng jīm-jiork-sîm-phoa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>嚨喉<rt>나ᄋᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>出力<rt>춛ˆ랃ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>出聲<rt>춛ˆ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-áu chût-lât kông-boe-chût-siâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>大鐵圍山<rt>대팋ˆ위솰ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無間地獄<rt>뿌간ˉ데꼑ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tai-thîh-wi-soâ̰ bu-kān-te-giêk\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>火燒<rt>훼ˆ쇼ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>獄城<rt>꼑샬ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>十萬<rt>잡빤-</rt></ruby><ruby>八千<rt>뵣ˆ촁ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    huê-siō-giek-siá̰ jap-ban-poêh-chiêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>斡頭<rt>왇ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oat-tháu khoà̰-bó lai-sí’e lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>明王<rt>뼹엉ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>指引<rt>지인ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>頭前<rt>ᄐᅷ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>光明<rt>겅ˉ뼹ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bieng-óng ji-în-thau-jiéng kōng-biéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>望<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-si-kòng, goà khoà̰-thḭ̂ bo-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>坦白<rt>탄ˆ벻-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>望<rt>빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>地<rt>되ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thân-peh-kòng, ma-bang-toē bo-lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一个人<rt>짇에랑ˊ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>喙<rt>취</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>舌<rt>짛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-e-láng, bo-chui ma-bo-jîh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>孤身<rt>거ˉ신ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>流轉<rt>류좐ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>北陰酆都<rt>박ˆ임ˉ헝ˉ더ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kōr-sîn liu-joân-ti-pâk-īm-hōng-tôr\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>陰風中<rt>임ˉ헝ˉ뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>聽<rt>턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>枵鬼<rt>ᄋᆤˉ귀ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>爬<rt>베ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    īm-hōng-tiông, thiā̰-yāu-kùi lêh-pé\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心<rt>심ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>驚驚<rt>걀ˉ걀ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>見<rt>길ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>十殿閻君<rt>잡뎬꺔군ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-kiā̰-kiâ̰, kḭ̀-jap-tien-giam-kûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>慐慐<rt>껑껑-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>等<rt>단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>烏白無常<rt>어ˉ벻뿌셩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gong-gong-sêh, tân-ōr-peh-bu-sióng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>揞腰<rt>알ˋ요ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>牽<rt>칸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攝<rt>럅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>亡魂<rt>뻥훈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    à̰-yô khān-goà liâp-goà’e bong-hún\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    &#8220;<ruby>頭<rt>ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>犁犁<rt>레레ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>少年家<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄게ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>斡<rt>왇-</rt></ruby><ruby>去<rt>킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby>?</span>&#8221;\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    “tháu le-lé’e siàu-lien-kê, lì bêh-oat-khì-tô-wī?”\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>滿面<rt>뫄ˆ삔ˉ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>風霜<rt>헝ˉ성ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>拄<rt>두ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>百<rt>밯ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>千<rt>촁ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>萬<rt>빤-</rt></ruby><ruby>劫<rt>걉</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    moâ-bīn hōng-sông, tû-tioh-pâh-chiēng-ban-kiap\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    &#8220;<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">噉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">감ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>鬼仔<rt>귀ˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>煞<rt>쇃</rt></ruby>’둏? <ruby>櫳仔<rt>렁아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>內面<rt>래삔ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>.</span>&#8221;\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    “kâm-si-hor-kûi-à soah’tioh? long-à lai-bīn’e láng.”\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>名<rt>먀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>姓<rt>셀</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>恬恬<rt>댬댬ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>擲<rt>단ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>塗跤<rt>터카ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-miá bo-sḛ tiam-tiām, hor-láng tàn-ti-thor-khâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>凡勢<rt>환세</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>意外<rt>이ˋ꽈ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>抑<rt>얗</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>生<rt>셀ˆ</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby>注定<rt>주ˋ댤ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-se si-ì-goā, yah-si-sḛ̂’lai jù-tiā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">敢逽<rt class=\"tli-rt\">갈ˆ나ˆ</rt></ruby><ruby>一場<rt>짇듈-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>夢<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>規<rt>귀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>身軀<rt>신ˉ쿠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>輕鬆<rt>킨ˉ상ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâ̰-nâ-jit-tiṵ-bāng, kūi-sīn-khû khīn-sâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>火王爺<rt>훼ˆ엉야ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>現身<rt>혠신ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>目睭<rt>빡쥬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>擘<rt>벻ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>金金<rt>김ˉ김ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    huê-ong-yá hien-sîn, bak-jiû pêh-kīm-kîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>煩惱<rt>환로ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>烌<rt>후ˆ</rt></ruby>’킈 <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>白色<rt>벻셱</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>水<rt>쥐ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-lò lông-hû’khi bo-peh-siek’e jùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>複製<rt>헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby> <ruby>複製<rt>헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>勇氣<rt>영ˆ키</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hôrk-jè-lì’e ai hôrk-jè-lì’e yông-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>複製<rt>헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>眼<rt>깐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>複製<rt>헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>靈魂<rt>롕훈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hôrk-jè-lì’e gàn hôrk-jè-lì’e lieng-hún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>複製<rt>헉ˆ제ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>淚<rt>뤼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>幻化<rt>환화ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>阿修羅<rt>아ˉ슈ˉ로ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hôrk-jè-lì’e lūi hoan-hoà-ā-siū-ló\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>代<rt>대ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>堪<rt>캄ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一切<rt>읻ˆ체-</rt></ruby><ruby>絕望<rt>좓뻥ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>火<rt>훼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tài-lì khām-ît-che-joat-bōng’e huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>轉輪聖王<rt>좐ˆ룬솅ˋ엉ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>起身<rt>키ˆ신ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>守護<rt>슈ˆ허-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>名<rt>먀-</rt></ruby><ruby>人客<rt>랑켛</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    joân-lun-sièng-óng khî-sîn, siû-hor-bo-mia-lang-kheh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>遠遠<rt>흥흥ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>聲<rt>샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>傳<rt>퇀ˊ</rt></ruby>’래, <ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>祈求<rt>기규ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hng-hn̄g’e siâ̰ thoán’lai, ī’e ki-kiú\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>眾神<rt>졍ˋ신ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攑<rt>꺟-</rt></ruby><ruby>燈<rt>뎽ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>相送<rt>쇼ˉ상</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>看顧<rt>콸ˋ거ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有情眾生<rt>유ˆ졩졍ˋ솅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiòng-sín giah-tiēng-siō-sang, khoà̰-kòr-yû-jieng-jiòng-siêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一生<rt>읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>珠淚<rt>주ˉ뤼ˉ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>落塗<rt>롷터ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>路邊<rt>러빌ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>紅花<rt>앙훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>清芳<rt>촁ˉ팡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ît-siêng jū-lūi loh-thór, lor-pḭ̂ ang-huê chiēng-phâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>隱痀橋<rt>운ˆ구ˉ교ˊ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>終點<rt>졍ˉ댬ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>自由<rt>주유ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>向望<rt>응ˋ빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ti-ûn-kū-kió jiōng-tiàm, si-ju-yú’e ǹg-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>望<rt>빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>平平安安<rt>볭볭안ˉ안ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bang-lì e-tàng-pieng-pieng-ān-ân\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>放<rt>방ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>記<rt>기</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>月娘<rt>뀋뉴ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>照<rt>죠ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pàng-boe-ki’e rin-siêng, u-gueh-niú lêh-jiò-lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>祝<rt>젹ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一世人<rt>짇시ˋ랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>傷悲<rt>셩ˉ비ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiôrk-lì kia̰-kuè-jit-sì-láng’e siōng-pî\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>拔<rt>뷯ˆ</rt></ruby>’퀴 <ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>手內<rt>츄ˆ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>헤<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>縛<rt>박ˆ</rt></ruby>’ᄃᆤ에 <ruby>鐵鏈<rt>팋ˆ롄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pûih’khui lî-chiû-lāi hē-pâk’tiau-e thîh-liēn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>傷<rt>셩ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>痕<rt>훈ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>疼<rt>턀</rt></ruby>’앟\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-siông bo-hún boe-kôh-thia̰’ah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>拍<rt>팧ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>見<rt>길</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>身軀<rt>신ˉ쿠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>揣<rt>췌-</rt></ruby><ruby>倒轉<rt>도ˋ등ˋ</rt></ruby>’래\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    phâh-m-kḭ’e sīn-khû lông-chue-tò-tǹg’lai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>頭前<rt>ᄐᅷ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>等<rt>단ˋ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thau-jiéng u-láng lêh-tàn’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n"
}
